er party or which is attributable to a period prior to such termination nor preclude either party from pursuing any rights and remedies it may have with respect to any breach of this Agreement.\n\n8. Payments\n\n8.1. Payment Terms for Partners (Delivery-Partners)\n\n8.1.1. Delivery-Partner charges a fee for Your use of the Service (Delivery Fee). The Service Fee may be at minimum MYR5.00 up to an amount depending on Consumer\'s delivery location as communicated to and accepted by You before You commence provision of the Solution(s). The Service Fees are payable by You immediately and are non-refundable. Any refund policy shall apply solely at the discretion of Merchant-Partners regardless of Your decision to terminate Your access to the Application / Platform, Our decision to terminate or suspend Your access to the Application / Platform, disruption caused to the Service whether planned, accidental, or intentional, or any reason whatsoever.\n\n8.1.2. YOU ACKNOWLEDGE AND CONFIRM THAT VALUEAT DO NOT ADMINISTER AND ACT AS YOUR COLLECTION AGENT TO PAY TO YOU THE TOTAL AMOUNT OF CONSUMER CHARGES DUE TO YOU IN RESPECT OF YOUR PROVISION OF THE SOLUTION.\n\n8.1.3. Valueat retains the right to suspend the processing of any transaction where it reasonably believes that the transaction may be fraudulent, illegal or involves any criminal activity or where You and/or the Consumer have breached any of the Terms in this Agreement. In such an event, You shall not hold Valueat liable for any withholding of, delay in, suspension, forfeiture or cancellation of, any payment(s) to You.\n\n8.2. Payment Terms for Consumers:\n\n8.2.1. Consumers are required to make full payment of the Consumers Charges for all services offered in the Application by the method selected at the time of ordering, which may be cash, or one of the automated payment methods available to You on the Application. Any payment pursuant to such selection is non-refundable and irrevocable unless otherwise agreed and solely under the discretion of Merchant-Partners.\n\n8.2.2. Automated payment may be made by direct bank transfer, credit card and or debit card, by Bayarlah, alternative e-Wallets or by PayLater or where available by such other methods as are made available in the Application. The terms of these non-cash payments made by You through the Application will be governed by the Valueat Terms and Conditions, accessible via the Application.\n\n8.2.3. YOU ACKNOWLEDGE AND CONFIRM THAT VALUEAT DO NOT ADMINISTER AND ACT AS YOUR COLLECTION AGENT TO PAY TO YOU THE TOTAL AMOUNT OF CONSUMER CHARGES DUE TO YOU IN RESPECT OF YOUR PROVISION OF THE SOLUTION.\n\n9. Cancellation\n\n9.1. For Delivery-Partners:\n\n9.1.1. The Consumers rely on You for delivery or provision of the Solutions. You agree that high and/or frequent cancellation rates or ignoring the Consumers\' orders will impair the Consumers\' experience and negatively impact the reputation and branding of Valueat.\n\n9.1.2. While You may cancel an order, the cancellation shall be based on acceptable cancellation reasons as shown in the Application. Valueat reserves the right to amend the acceptable cancellation reasons from time to time. A cancellation that is not based on one of the acceptable reasons or ignoring an order may be counted in determining if Your access to the Service will be temporarily restricted.\n\n9.2. For Consumers:\n\n9.2.1. You may cancel Your request for Service at any time before You commence Your Service with the Partner that has been matched with You by the Service.\n\n9.2.2. If You decide to cancel Your order or do not show up at the designated location, You may be charged a Cancellation Fee or such other Cancellation Fee as Valueat and Partner may notify from time to time via the Application or any other means of communication.\n\n10. Valueat Promotions for Consumers\n\n10.1. From time to time, Valueat may run marketing and promotional campaigns which offer voucher codes, discounts, subscription plans, or other promotional offers to be used on the Platforms (Vouchers). Vouchers are subject to validity periods, redemption periods, limits and/or availability. Vouchers may not be valid when used in conjunction with other promotions, discounts, or other vouchers. Additional terms and conditions may apply to Vouchers. Unless otherwise stated, Vouchers can only be used on Our Platforms. Vouchers are non-transferable, non-exchangeable and non-refundable and cannot be exchanged for cash. Valueat reserves the right to withdraw, amend and/or alter any part of the terms and conditions of the promotions and subscriptions at any time without any prior notice. Valueat reserves the right to void, discontinue or disqualify You from any promotion or subscription plan without prior notice to You , in the event You breach any part of these Terms and Conditions.\n\n11. Complaints\n\n11.1. Any complaints between Partners and Consumers must be taken up with each other directly.\n\n12. Repair and Cleaning Fees for Consumers\n\n12.1. Where applicable, You shall be responsible for the cost of repairing any damage to or necessary cleaning of the Partner\'s property as a result of Your misuse of the Service or breach of the Terms and Conditions herein.\n\n13. Intellectual Property Ownership\n\n13.1. Valueat and its licensors, where applicable, shall own all right, title, and interest, including all related intellectual property rights, in and to the Software and/or the Application and by extension, the Service and any suggestions, ideas, enhancement requests, feedback, recommendations or other information provided by You or any other party relating to the Service. The Terms and Conditions do not constitute a sale agreement and do not convey to You any rights of ownership in or related to the Service, the Software and/or the Application, or any intellectual property rights owned by Valueat and/or its licensors. Valueat\'s name, Valueat\'s logo, the Service, the Software and/or the Applicat